{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51329","headline":"望仙门 · 李愿","name":"望仙门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼影空门里，门开望衆仙。\n绿鬟云漠漠，翠黛月涓涓。\n烟驾知何处，星槎记昔年。\n夕阳孤鸟畔，渺渺海浮天。\n（《古今图集当成·职方典》二八○《登州府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李愿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}